---
import AgentFlow from './AgentFlow.astro';
import McpUseCase from './McpUseCase.astro';
import TryPath from './TryPath.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
import '../styles/home-v3.css';
const ja = Astro.props.lang === 'ja';
---
{ja ? <Fragment>
<div class="home home-v3">
<div class="v3-intro">
<p class="lede">プロバイダーの認証情報とモデルの振り分けを、ゲートウェイに集約。Rubyで判断し、nginxで中継します。</p>
<div class="v3-entry">
<p class="actions">
<a class="button-primary" href="/ja/guides/agent-proxy/">動くプロキシの例を見る <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</a>
<a class="button-secondary" href="/ja/reference/directives/">APIリファレンス</a>
</p>
<span class="v3-status">3.x・開発中</span>
</div>
</div>
<p class="v3-purpose">複数のエージェントを運用する開発者へ。クライアントごとの認証と転送ルールを、プロキシ側にまとめます。</p>
<AgentFlow lang="ja" />
<McpUseCase lang="ja" />

<TryPath lang="ja" />
<section class="v3-code" aria-labelledby="code-title">
<div class="v3-section-heading">
<h2 id="code-title">モデル名から、転送先を選ぶ。</h2>
<p>テストで使うRubyと、その検証結果。キーと転送先はmock用です。</p>
</div>
<slot />
<a class="section-link" href="/ja/guides/agent-proxy/">完全な設定・実行条件を見る <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</a>
</section>

<section class="v3-future" aria-labelledby="future-title">
<img src="/brand/ngx-mruby-llm-proxy.svg" alt="" width="128" height="128" />
<div>
<span class="v3-status">planned</span>
<h2 id="future-title">v3で追加する制御</h2>
<p>共有の使用量集計・イベント単位の処理・最初の応答までの期限。現在のAPIとしては使えません。</p>
<a href="/ja/guides/agent-proxy/">実装状況と計画 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</a>
</div>
</section>

<section class="v3-protocols" aria-labelledby="protocol-title">
<h2 id="protocol-title">HTTP・TCPにも、同じ組み込み方。</h2>
<div class="protocol-http">
<img src="/brand/ngx-mruby-http.svg" alt="" width="96" height="96" />
<div>
<h3>APIの振り分け・アクセス判定</h3>
<p>リクエストのヘッダを読み、既存のupstreamへ転送。</p>
<div class="protocol-path">
<span>HTTP</span>
<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
<span>Ruby</span>
<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
<span>upstream</span>
</div>
<a href="/ja/guides/routing/">HTTPの実行例 →</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="protocol-stream">
<img src="/brand/ngx-mruby-stream.svg" alt="" width="80" height="80" />
<div>
<h3>TCP接続の許可・拒否</h3>
<p>接続元を確認してから、バックエンドへつなぐ。</p>
<div class="protocol-path">
<span>TCP</span>
<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
<span>allow / deny</span>
</div>
<a href="/ja/guides/tcp/">TCPの実行例 →</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="v3-bottom">
<div>
<h2>実装に使う資料</h2>
<p>版・ソース・検証条件を含む本文を、HTMLとMarkdownで。</p>
<a href="/ja/docs/">HTML →</a>
<a href="/docs-index.json">Markdown index →</a>
</div>
<div class="stable-entry">
<h2>既存の2.7を使う場合</h2>
<a href="/v2/ja/">安定版の導入・ドキュメント →</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</Fragment> : <Fragment>
<div class="home home-v3">
<div class="v3-intro">
<p class="lede">Keep provider credentials and model-routing rules at your gateway. nginx relays the stream; Ruby decides where it goes.</p>
<div class="v3-entry">
<p class="actions">
<a class="button-primary" href="/guides/agent-proxy/">Explore the proxy recipes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</a>
<a class="button-secondary" href="/reference/directives/">API reference</a>
</p>
<span class="v3-status">3.x · IN DEVELOPMENT</span>
</div>
</div>
<p class="v3-purpose">For developers running multiple agents: keep client access and routing rules at the proxy.</p>
<AgentFlow lang="en" />
<McpUseCase lang="en" />

<TryPath lang="en" />
<section class="v3-code" aria-labelledby="code-title">
<div class="v3-section-heading">
<h2 id="code-title">Route by the requested model.</h2>
<p>The Ruby handler and checked output from the integration test. Keys and upstreams are test fixtures.</p>
</div>
<slot />
<a class="section-link" href="/guides/agent-proxy/#recipes-that-run-today">Read the full configuration and prerequisites <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</a>
</section>

<section class="v3-future" aria-labelledby="future-title">
<img src="/brand/ngx-mruby-llm-proxy.svg" alt="" width="128" height="128" />
<div>
<span class="v3-status">planned</span>
<h2 id="future-title">Planned for v3</h2>
<p>Shared usage accounting, event-level processing and first-byte deadlines. These are not available APIs yet.</p>
<a href="/guides/agent-proxy/">Implementation status and plan <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</a>
</div>
</section>

<section class="v3-protocols" aria-labelledby="protocol-title">
<h2 id="protocol-title">The same embedding model for HTTP and TCP.</h2>
<div class="protocol-http">
<img src="/brand/ngx-mruby-http.svg" alt="" width="96" height="96" />
<div>
<h3>API routing and access checks</h3>
<p>Read request headers and choose a configured upstream.</p>
<div class="protocol-path">
<span>HTTP</span>
<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
<span>Ruby</span>
<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
<span>upstream</span>
</div>
<a href="/guides/routing/">HTTP walkthrough →</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="protocol-stream">
<img src="/brand/ngx-mruby-stream.svg" alt="" width="80" height="80" />
<div>
<h3>Allow or refuse TCP connections</h3>
<p>Check the client address before connecting to the backend.</p>
<div class="protocol-path">
<span>TCP</span>
<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
<span>allow / deny</span>
</div>
<a href="/guides/tcp/">TCP walkthrough →</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="v3-bottom">
<div>
<h2>Documentation for implementation</h2>
<p>HTML and Markdown from one source, with versions and validation context.</p>
<a href="/docs/">HTML →</a>
<a href="/docs-index.json">Markdown index →</a>
</div>
<div class="stable-entry">
<h2>Using the stable 2.7 release?</h2>
<a href="/v2/">Stable installation and documentation →</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</Fragment>}
